                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This month, I\u2019ve heard from many of you concerned about healthcare premiums increasing and the impacts of the government shutdown.\n \nI regularly write to update folks on what is happening in Congress and how I am fighting for San Antonians. Sign up below to join the conversation. https://t.co/kSzfixmEns",
