                "text": "Republicans are ripping away ACA premium tax credits, causing healthcare costs to soar by 35% in Texas on average. \n\nJust look the premium rates for 2026 compared to last year. Many families won\u2019t be able to afford it! \n\nRepublicans need to reopen the government and work with Democrats to lower healthcare costs.",
